{
 "duration": 175.21783333333335,
 "units": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": "Intro",
   "text": "You wake in the night because something near your bed made a sound.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.23
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "You open your eyes, and the black above you is not the ceiling.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 4.68,
   "end": 9.476
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It is two empty holes where eyes should be.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 9.776,
   "end": 12.933
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Something dark is running out of them.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 13.383,
   "end": 15.976
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Let us go back to the beginning.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 16.276,
   "end": 18.039
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Mitch lost his house that spring, so his brother Edwin took him in.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 18.489,
   "end": 23.487
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A cheap house at the end of a long street, pine woods behind the fence.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 23.937,
   "end": 29.289
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He took the back room.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 29.589,
   "end": 30.865
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A week in, a rustling under his window woke him at one in the morning.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 31.315,
   "end": 37.081
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Probably a raccoon.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 37.381,
   "end": 38.857
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The next night he woke all at once, sure he had heard the window lifted open.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 39.307,
   "end": 45.486
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then a soft, heavy thump, like a person landing with their knees bent.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 45.936,
   "end": 51.559
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The window was shut.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 51.859,
   "end": 53.133
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "In the morning Edwin dropped his coffee cup.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 53.583,
   "end": 56.672
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "There was a long clean cut down Mitch's cheek, and he had not felt it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 56.972,
   "end": 61.981
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The doctor said it was probably sleepwalking.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 62.431,
   "end": 65.132
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then he asked him to lift his shirt.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 65.432,
   "end": 67.92
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "There was a surgical cut in his side, closed with neat stitches.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 68.37,
   "end": 73.441
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "His left kidney was gone.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 73.741,
   "end": 75.594
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "That evening he went back to the same room.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 76.044,
   "end": 79.092
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "At midnight he opened his eyes, and it stood over his bed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 79.392,
   "end": 84.115
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A black hood.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 84.565,
   "end": 85.455
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A face the colour of old grey paint, with no nose and no mouth.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 85.755,
   "end": 91.555
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "beat": 13,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "His hand went sideways on its own, to the camera on the shelf, and took the picture.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 92.005,
   "end": 98.588
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The flash filled the room.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 99.038,
   "end": 100.588
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then the dark came back, and it came at him.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 100.888,
   "end": 104.075
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "beat": 15,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He kicked it in the face, ran barefoot into the woods, and tripped on a rock.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 104.525,
   "end": 110.629
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "beat": 16,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He woke in a hospital bed, and the doctor sat down, which nobody does when the news is good.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 111.079,
   "end": 118.784
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "beat": 17,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Mitch was only bruised.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 119.234,
   "end": 120.82
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "beat": 17,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "His brother had been found in the house that morning.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 121.12,
   "end": 124.427
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "beat": 18,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Three days later he went back for his things, and from his door he saw down the hallway.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 124.877,
   "end": 131.706
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "beat": 19,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Beside his brother was something small, wrapped in cloth.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 132.156,
   "end": 136.605
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "beat": 19,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He carried it out to the car.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 136.905,
   "end": 138.589
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "beat": 20,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Two streets away he opened it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 139.039,
   "end": 141.374
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "beat": 20,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was the piece taken out of his side, and some of it was gone.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 141.674,
   "end": 146.567
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "beat": 21,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The photograph is still on that camera.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 147.017,
   "end": 149.872
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "beat": 21,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It is dark and blurred, but the hood and the holes are there.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 150.172,
   "end": 154.743
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "beat": 22,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And in the picture it is not looking at Mitch.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 155.193,
   "end": 158.34
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "beat": 22,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It is looking past him, at his open door.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 158.64,
   "end": 161.755
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "beat": 23,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "This is my retelling of the creepypasta Eyeless Jack, posted by a user called Azelf5000.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 162.205,
   "end": 171.807
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "beat": 24,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Would you have taken the photograph?",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 172.257,
   "end": 174.018
  }
 ]
}